          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What does electronics recycling include in Bakersfield?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Electronics recycling in Bakersfield can include computers, laptops, mobile devices, networking hardware, printers, servers, monitors, ink, toner, and older equipment from business operations. STS coordinates pickup, sorting, data handling, asset reporting, and material recovery for organizations across Bakersfield and Kern County."
