          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What electronics can be recycled?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Bakersfield organizations can arrange recycling for computers, laptops, cell phones, networking equipment, printers, copiers, servers, monitors, ink and toner, and other retired electronics. STS supports equipment from offices, classrooms, clinics, field operations, production sites, warehouses, and distribution facilities."
          }
        },
