            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Pickup is free for qualifying volumes in Bakersfield and surrounding Kern County service areas. STS reviews equipment type, quantity, access conditions, and scheduling needs before confirming the service plan. Organizations can call 844-699-2913 or contact STS for an assessment."
